<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">

<head>
	<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" />
	<title>Advertise With ROBLOX</title>
	
	<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="css/roblox-sales.css" />
	<script type="text/JavaScript" src="css/curvycorners.js"></script>
	
	<script type="text/JavaScript">
	window.onload = function()
	{
		settings = {
			tl: { radius: 15 },
			tr: { radius: 15 },
			bl: { radius: 15 },
			br: { radius: 15 },
			antiAlias: true,
			autoPad: true,
			validTags: ["div"]
		}
	
		/* NOT WORKING IN IE YET - TRY LATER VERSION OF curvycorners */
	
/*		var myBoxObject = new curvyCorners(settings, "rounded-box");
		myBoxObject.applyCornersToAll();
		
		myBoxObject = new curvyCorners(settings, "navpane-box");
		myBoxObject.applyCornersToAll(); */
	}
	</script>

</head>

<body>
	<div id="MasterContainer">
		<div id="PageContainer">
		
			<div id="Header">
				<img class="PageLogo" src="RobloxLogo.png" />
			</div>
			
			<div id="Menu">
				<div class="menu">The Online Virtual World &amp; Building Game for Kids</div>
			</div>
			
			<div id="Nav" class="navpane-box">
				<h2>Contact Us</h2>
				<ul>
					<li><a href="mailto:sales@roblox.com">sales@roblox.com</a></li>
					<li><a href="mailto:press@roblox.com">press@roblox.com</a></li>
					<li>(888)&nbsp;858-BLOX&nbsp;x3</li>
					<li><a href="http://www.roblox.com">www.roblox.com</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			
			<div id="Body" class="rounded-box">

				<h1>Advertise with ROBLOX</h1>
	
				<p>
					ROBLOX is an online virtual world and building game for kids. We have a large, growing, and 
					highly targeted user base of kids aged 7 through 15, with reach to higher teens and parents.
					Our users are highly diverse, ranging from early adopters to mainstream players, from 
					video game pros to sports fans, from budding engineers to up-and-coming marketing and finance gurus.
				</p>
				<p>
					If you want to reach kids and their parents, we’re it.
				</p>
				<p align="center">
				<object width="480" height="295"><param name="movie" value="http://www.youtube.com/v/OBUlpvyInzg&hl=en&fs=1"></param><param name="allowFullScreen" value="true"></param><param name="allowscriptaccess" value="always"></param><embed src="http://www.youtube.com/v/OBUlpvyInzg&hl=en&fs=1" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" allowscriptaccess="always" allowfullscreen="true" width="480" height="295"></embed></object>
				</p>
				<p>
					ROBLOX reaches over one million kids from higher-income families every month. We're also ranked&nbsp;
					#1 in comScore for user engagement among all kids sites, highlighting the passion and loyalty of 
					our users.&nbsp;<span class="source">(comScore: January 2009)</span>
				</p>
				<p>We offer four advertising channels of increasing engagement: traditional display advertising, 
				page takeovers, sponsored contests and games, and immersive in-game advertising – create a 
				branded shirt, car, billboard, movie theater, or jukebox that blasts virally through our site. 
				Contact us for more information!
				</p>
				<p>
					ROBLOX complies with COPPA (Children’s Online Privacy Protection Act) and 
					is TRUSTe certified for kids’ privacy.	
				</p>
			</div>
			
		</div>
	</div>

</body>
